    "explanation": "Weighted cyclic dispatch: sort tenant IDs, expand each by weight into slots, and retain a cursor plus FIFO queues. Add rejects any pending duplicate. Dispatch scans one cycle from the cursor and advances to the slot after the selected tenant.",
    "mapping": "The rule maps config.weights to the fixed cycle, state to cursor and pending queues, and each event to one status/output snapshot.",
